tegories":"Restaurants","shared_category_count":1},{"business_id":"Zi-F-YvyVOK0k5QD7lrLOg","name":"Muriel's Jackson Square","shared_categories":"Restaurants","shared_category_count":1},{"business_id":"JhpRI9m71ybWHkAqRdL0Tg","name":"The Avenue Pub","shared_categories":"Restaurants","shared_category_count":1},{"business_id":"_Bi9kN_eR75G1eqIl7S3pA","name":"The Bulldog","shared_categories":"Restaurants","shared_category_count":1},{"business_id":"AU-B663F3MPO7W-goWwwXA","name":"B Mac's","shared_categories":"","shared_category_count":0},{"business_id":"pKykk7lnD6Tf9wSzJYRyJA","name":"Starbucks","shared_categories":"","shared_category_count":0}],"text":[{"business_id":"EV4f9j7k5P3ItvJAGu5AWA","review_id":"Sk_KHJmUFAKflqJdZB82MQ","date":"2018-04-12T19:26:42","stars":4,"text_representativeness":0.9357602000236511,"text_excerpt":"Food was very good and the staff was very friendly. Italian bread on the table when we sat was delicious. We started with Charcuterie. It was good, although the cheese to meat ratio was definitely off and way too many crackers. They had a special of Alaskan King Crab Legs, which were absolutely delicious! Even came cracked opened for you:) My husband had their Tortellacci. Which is homemade tortellini stuffed with short ribs in a pork and red gravy. It was so yummy, i totally wanted to steal my husband's plate! Next time in the area, will definitely go back:)"},{"business_id":"EV4f9j7k5P3ItvJAGu5AWA","review_id":"gIGabtSp0qRbmj7aDIK0aw","date":"2020-07-26T15:51:12","stars":4,"text_representativeness":0.9345129132270813,"text_excerpt":"As I'm sitting here still mesmerized by my dinner from yesterday night I'll say it was a WELL DESERVED TREAT! So right now they are doing dine-in services but ya gotta. MASK UP for entry. This little piece of art is located in the lake view area. There's parking all around the establishment and around the street as well. They do have patio seating available too if you don't want to sit inside. We were greet kindly and there was when the experience began. It felt like I was walking through one of Al Clapones fav. High end restaurant. Velvet red seats and also red carpet retro cool wine cellar vibe. Out kind waiter Matthew helped us our on ordering and so we started with a some great drinks..."},{"business_id":"EV4f9j7k5P3ItvJAGu5AWA","review_id":"mud0W8OYdrdJOoM8DDMNjg","date":"2019-12-01T21:41:29","stars":5,"text_representativeness":0.9305535554885864,"text_excerpt":"Omg Laurie and Jarod made this dinner so special for my cousin, her fiancé and me! We've all been wanting to go to this restaurant for a long time but it always seems packed. So thankfully we picked a Saturday evening during thanksgiving break when the LSU game was on so it we were able to get in! My cousin and her fiancé were so sweet and wanted to take me out to dinner bc I helped decorate the spot where they got engaged last week! Laurie made us feel like queens after I joyfully told her that my cousin and her fiancé just got engaged last week and I was a part of it! She told us the specials and gave us awesome recommendations! She even served us the best crab cake appetizer I've ever ..."}],"visual":[{"business_id":"EV4f9j7k5P3ItvJAGu5AWA","photo_id":"Kmd6lpPwcwdy8KZlHNWAlQ","label":"drink","image_url":"/photos/Kmd6lpPwcwdy8KZlHNWAlQ.jpg","visual_representativeness":0.8889080286026001},{"business_id":"EV4f9j7k5P3ItvJAGu5AWA","photo_id":"3ZnNSl6HTCqKrECUnrJN9w","label":"food","image_url":"/photos/3ZnNSl6HTCqKrECUnrJN9w.jpg","visual_representativeness":0.8757992386817932},{"business_id":"EV4f9j7k5P3ItvJAGu5AWA","photo_id":"uB3IWZRwnUJP16aCUMQJyg","label":"inside","image_url":"/photos/uB3IWZRwnUJP16aCUMQJyg.jpg","visual_representativeness":0.8367307782173157},{"business_id":"EV4f9j7k5P3ItvJAGu5AWA","photo_id":"lSMss3x4EFzulHdWg4Z1OA","label":"food","image_url":"/photos/lSMss3x4EFzulHdWg4Z1OA.jpg","visual_representativeness":0.8304007053375244},{"business_id":"EV4f9j7k5P3ItvJAGu5AWA","photo_id":"et32TVXL0q1d2y7nWmeZ